Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:08:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add simple WiFi WebuiPage

- Add Wi-Fi settings view with network list and signal strength bars
- Add /settings/wifi route and navigation entry
- Add featureFlags so the page is only enabled with VITE_WIFI_UI_API=true

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe specific]
